    "description" : "Ensures that source files do not exceed a maximum number of lines to maintain readability and manageability.",
    "explanation" : "# File Length\n\nFiles should not span too many lines.\n\n* **Identifier:** `file_length`\n* **Enabled by default:** Yes\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** metrics\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  400\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  error\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  1000\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  ignore_comment_only_lines\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  false\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint(\"swiftlint\")\nprint