    "id" : "function_name_whitespace",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Function Name Whitespace",
    "description" : "Ensure consistent whitespace before and after function names and generic parameter lists in Swift functions.",
    "explanation" : "# Function Name Whitespace\n\nThere should be consistent whitespace before and after function names and generic parameters.\n\n* **Identifier:** `function_name_whitespace`\n* **Enabled by default:** Yes\n* **Supports autocorrection:** Yes\n* **Kind:** style\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  generic_spacing\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  no_space\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nfunc abc(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <| (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|< <A>(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <| /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|< /* comment */ <A>(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|< <A> /* comment */ (lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <| /* comment */ <T> /* comment */ (lhs: T, rhs: T) -> T {}\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc abc<T>(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_space\n//\n\nfunc abc <T>(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc<T> (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_space\n//\n\nfunc abc <T>(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_space\n//\n\nfunc abc /* comment */ <T> /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc /* comment */ <T> /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc <T> (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc /* comment */ abc(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc /* comment */  abc(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc abc /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc abc /* comment */ <T>(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc abc<T> /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc abc /* comment */ <T> /* comment */ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc foo<\n   T\n>(\n   param1: Int,\n   param2: Bool,\n   param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc foo <\nT\n> (\n    param1: Int,\n    param2: Bool,\n    param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc foo /* comment */ <\nT\n> (\n    param1: Int,\n    param2: Bool,\n    param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nfunc↓  name(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc name↓ (lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc↓  name↓ (lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|↓(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|<↓<A>(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|↓  (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|<↓  <A>(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|↓/* comment */  (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|<↓/* comment */  <A>(lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc <|< <A>↓/* comment */  (lhs: A, rhs: A) -> A {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc name↓ <T>(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc name↓ /* comment */  <T>↓  /* comment */  (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc name /* comment */ /* comment */  <T>↓  /* comment */  (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc foo<\n   T\n>↓ (\n   param1: Int,\n   param2: Bool,\n   param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc foo↓ <\n   T\n>(\n   param1: Int,\n   param2: Bool,\n   param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: no_space\n//\n\nfunc foo↓ <\n  T\n>↓ (\n   param1: Int,\n   param2: Bool,\n   param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_space\n//\n\nfunc abc <T>↓ (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_space\n//\n\nfunc foo <\nT\n>↓ (\n    param1: Int,\n    param2: Bool,\n    param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc↓ <T> (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc foo↓ <\nT\n> (\n    param1: Int,\n    param2: Bool,\n    param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc↓<T> (lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc <T>↓(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc abc↓<T>↓(lhs: Int, rhs: Int) -> Int {}\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n// generic_spacing: leading_trailing_space\n//\n\nfunc foo↓ /* comment */  <\nT\n>↓  (\n    param1: Int,\n    param2: Bool,\n    param3: [String]\n) { }\n\n```",
