  {
    "id" : "function_parameter_count",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "Complexity",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Limit Function Parameter Count",
    "description" : "Enforces that functions have a low number of parameters to improve readability and maintainability.",
    "explanation" : "# Function Parameter Count\n\nNumber of function parameters should be low.\n\n* **Identifier:** `function_parameter_count`\n* **Enabled by default:** Yes\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** metrics\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  5\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  error\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  8\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  ignores_default_parameters\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  true\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\ninit(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\ninit (a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\n`init`(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\ninit?(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\ninit?<T>(a: T, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\ninit?<T: String>(a: T, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc f2(p1: Int, p2: Int) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc f(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, x: Int = 42) {}\n```\n\n```swift\nfunc f(a: [Int], b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, f: Int) -> [Int] {\n    let s = a.flatMap { $0 as? [String: Int] } ?? []}}\n```\n\n```swift\noverride func f(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\n↓func f(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\n↓func initialValue(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\nprivate ↓func f(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int = 2, g: Int) {}\n```\n\n```swift\nstruct Foo {\n    init(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}\n    ↓func bar(a: Int, b: Int, c: Int, d: Int, e: Int, f: Int) {}}\n```",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 10,
