  {
    "id" : "ibinspectable_in_extension",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid IBInspectable in Extension",
    "description" : "This rule disallows adding @IBInspectable properties in Swift extensions.",
    "explanation" : "# IBInspectable in Extension\n\nExtensions shouldn't add @IBInspectable properties\n\n* **Identifier:** `ibinspectable_in_extension`\n* **Enabled by default:** No\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** lint\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nclass Foo {\n  @IBInspectable private var x: Int\n}\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nextension Foo {\n  ↓@IBInspectable private var x: Int\n}\n```",
