    "id" : "multiline_arguments",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Consistent Multiline Arguments",
    "description" : "Ensures that function or method call arguments are either all on the same line or each argument is on its own line.",
    "explanation" : "# Multiline Arguments\n\nArguments should be either on the same line, or one per line\n\n* **Identifier:** `multiline_arguments`\n* **Enabled by default:** No\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** style\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  first_argument_location\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  any_line\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  only_enforce_after_first_closure_on_first_line\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  false\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nfoo()\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(\n)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo {\n\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, 1)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, 1) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, param1: 1)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, param1: 1) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1, param2: true) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1, param2: true, param3: [3]) { }\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1, param2: true, param3: [3]) {\n    bar()\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(param1: 1,\n    param2: true,\n    param3: [3])\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(\n    param1: 1, param2: true, param3: [3]\n)\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(\n    param1: 1,\n    param2: true,\n    param3: [3]\n)\n```\n\n```swift\nPicker(selection: viewStore.binding(\\.$someProperty)) {\n   ForEach(SomeEnum.allCases, id: \\.rawValue) { someCase in\n      Text(someCase.rawValue)\n         .tag(someCase)\n   }\n} label: {\n   EmptyView()\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nUIView.animate(withDuration: 1,\n               delay: 0) {\n    // sample\n    print(\"a\")\n} completion: { _ in\n    // sample\n    print(\"b\")\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nUIView.animate(withDuration: 1, delay: 0) {\n    print(\"a\")\n} completion: { _ in\n    print(\"b\")\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nf(\n    foo: 1,\n    bar: false,\n)\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nfoo(0,\n    param1: 1, ↓param2: true, ↓param3: [3])\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, ↓param1: 1,\n    param2: true, ↓param3: [3])\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(0, ↓param1: 1, ↓param2: true,\n    param3: [3])\n```\n\n```swift\nfoo(\n    0, ↓param1: 1,\n    param2: true, ↓param3: [3]\n)\n```",
