  {
    "id" : "raw_value_for_camel_cased_codable_enum",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Raw Value for Camel Cased Codable String Enum Cases",
    "description" : "Ensures that camel cased cases of Codable String enums have explicit raw string values.",
    "explanation" : "# Raw Value for Camel Cased Codable Enum\n\nCamel cased cases of Codable String enums should have raw values\n\n* **Identifier:** `raw_value_for_camel_cased_codable_enum`\n* **Enabled by default:** No\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** lint\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nenum Numbers: Codable {\n  case int(Int)\n  case short(Int16)\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Numbers: Int, Codable {\n  case one = 1\n  case two = 2\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Numbers: Double, Codable {\n  case one = 1.1\n  case two = 2.2\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Numbers: String, Codable {\n  case one = \"one\"\n  case two = \"two\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Codable {\n    case OK, ACCEPTABLE\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Codable {\n    case ok\n    case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String {\n    case ok\n    case notAcceptable\n    case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: Int, Codable {\n    case ok\n    case notAcceptable\n    case maybeAcceptable = -1\n}\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Codable {\n    case ok\n    case ↓notAcceptable\n    case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Decodable {\n   case ok\n   case ↓notAcceptable\n   case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Encodable {\n   case ok\n   case ↓notAcceptable\n   case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```\n\n```swift\nenum Status: String, Codable {\n    case ok\n    case ↓notAcceptable\n    case maybeAcceptable = \"maybe_acceptable\"\n}\n```",
