    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Sorted Imports",
    "description" : "This rule enforces that import statements in Swift files are sorted alphabetically.",
    "explanation" : "# Sorted Imports\n\nImports should be sorted\n\n* **Identifier:** `sorted_imports`\n* **Enabled by default:** No\n* **Supports autocorrection:** Yes\n* **Kind:** style\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  grouping\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  names\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nimport AAA\nimport BBB\nimport CCC\nimport DDD\n```\n\n```swift\nimport Alamofire\nimport API\n```\n\n```swift\nimport labc\nimport Ldef\n```\n\n```swift\nimport BBB\n// comment\nimport AAA\nimport CCC\n```\n\n```swift\n@testable import AAA\nimport   CCC\n```\n\n```swift\nimport AAA\n@testable import   CCC\n```\n\n```swift\nimport EEE.A\nimport FFF.B\n#if os(Linux)\nimport DDD.A\nimport EEE.B\n#else\nimport CCC\nimport DDD.B\n#endif\nimport AAA\nimport BBB\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nimport AAA\nimport ZZZ\nimport ↓BBB\nimport CCC\n```\n\n```swift\nimport DDD\n// comment\nimport CCC\nimport ↓AAA\n```\n\n```swift\n@testable import CCC\nimport   ↓AAA\n```\n\n```swift\nimport CCC\n@testable import   ↓AAA\n```\n\n```swift\nimport FFF.B\nimport ↓EEE.A\n#if os(Linux)\nimport DDD.A\nimport EEE.B\n#else\nimport DDD.B\nimport ↓CCC\n#endif\nimport AAA\nimport BBB\n```",
