    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Resolve TODO and FIXME Comments",
    "description" : "This rule detects TODO and FIXME comments in Swift code that indicate unresolved tasks or issues.",
    "explanation" : "# Todo\n\nTODOs and FIXMEs should be resolved.\n\n* **Identifier:** `todo`\n* **Enabled by default:** Yes\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** lint\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  only\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  [TODO, FIXME]\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\n// notaTODO:\n```\n\n```swift\n// notaFIXME:\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\n// ↓TODO:\n```\n\n```swift\n// ↓FIXME:\n```\n\n```swift\n// ↓TODO(note)\n```\n\n```swift\n// ↓FIXME(note)\n```\n\n```swift\n/* ↓FIXME: */\n```\n\n```swift\n/* ↓TODO: */\n```\n\n```swift\n/** ↓FIXME: */\n```\n\n```swift\n/** ↓TODO: */\n```",
