    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Trailing Whitespace",
    "description" : "This rule enforces that lines should not have trailing whitespace characters at the end.",
    "explanation" : "# Trailing Whitespace\n\nLines should not have trailing whitespace\n\n* **Identifier:** `trailing_whitespace`\n* **Enabled by default:** Yes\n* **Supports autocorrection:** Yes\n* **Kind:** style\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  ignores_empty_lines\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  false\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  ignores_comments\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  true\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nlet name: String\n\n```\n\n```swift\n//\n\n```\n\n```swift\n// \n\n```\n\n```swift\nlet name: String //\n\n```\n\n```swift\nlet name: String // \n\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nlet name: String↓ \n\n```\n\n```swift\n/* */ let name: String↓ \n\n```",
