    "id" : "yoda_condition",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Yoda Condition",
    "description" : "Ensures that constant literals are placed on the right-hand side of comparison operators.",
    "explanation" : "# Yoda Condition\n\nThe constant literal should be placed on the right-hand side of the comparison operator\n\n* **Identifier:** `yoda_condition`\n* **Enabled by default:** No\n* **Supports autocorrection:** No\n* **Kind:** lint\n* **Analyzer rule:** No\n* **Minimum Swift compiler version:** 5.0.0\n* **Default configuration:**\n  <table>\n  <thead>\n  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  severity\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  warning\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n## Non Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nif foo == 42 {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif foo <= 42.42 {}\n```\n\n```swift\nguard foo >= 42 else { return }\n```\n\n```swift\nguard foo != \"str str\" else { return }\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile foo < 10 { }\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile foo > 1 { }\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile foo + 1 == 2 {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif optionalValue?.property ?? 0 == 2 {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif foo == nil {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif flags & 1 == 1 {}\n```\n\n## Triggering Examples\n\n```swift\nif ↓42 == foo {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif ↓42.42 >= foo {}\n```\n\n```swift\nguard ↓42 <= foo else { return }\n```\n\n```swift\nguard ↓\"str str\" != foo else { return }\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile ↓10 > foo { }\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile ↓1 < foo { }\n```\n\n```swift\nif ↓nil == foo {}\n```\n\n```swift\nwhile ↓1 > i + 5 {}\n```\n\n```swift\nif ↓200 <= i && i <= 299 || ↓600 <= i {}\n```",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  }
